# Run Q (2026-11-08, user: "lets start with a fixed alpha" -> 0.02): run P2
# (slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5_orterm_idle_nb.env: SAC from scratch, no pretraining,
# Town05 + Town01, one update every 5 env steps, off-road terminal with the junction
# rule, idle charge 0.5 below 2 km/h, arrival at any speed) with the temperature
# FIXED at 0.02 instead of auto-tuned -- the only change.
#
# Why: in runs P and P2 the learned temperature fell 0.1 -> 1e-4 (the actor's
# entropy, ~1.3, never reached the -2 target). P2's evals (no speed rule, 40
# seeds/town) were best while it passed 0.036 (25k: 31/80, wrong-goal gap
# +.30/+.30) and 0.012 (50k: 36/80), and fell apart once it was gone (100k: 8/80)
# as the actor's mean ran to saturation. 0.02 sits between those two values; the
# textbook 0.2 is scaled for MuJoCo-size rewards (~1/step) and would keep this
# actor near uniform.
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_scratch_2t_u5_orterm_idle_nb.env"
export FIXED_ALPHA=0.02
